0008 — compiler/decl.rs: compile-time diagnostics found by the magic-methods
pass (apply on top of 0001-0007).

* Interface constants must be public (zend_declare_typed_class_constant):
  "Access type for interface constant %s::%s must be public"
  (tests/classes/interface_constant_inheritance_006, _007).
* zend_compile_func_decl: E_DEPRECATED "Making a constructor a Generator is
  deprecated" / "Making a destructor a Generator is deprecated"
  (Zend/tests/magic_methods/constructor_destructor_return).
* zend_check_magic_method_implementation: a __debugInfo() return type that
  admits null gives E_DEPRECATED "Returning null from %s::__debugInfo() is
  deprecated, make the return type non-nullable and return an empty array
  instead" (Zend/tests/magic_methods/magic_methods_inheritance_rules).
* "Private methods cannot be final as they are never overridden by other
  classes" is no longer pushed here: php-parser's validate.rs now emits it,
  so it was printed twice (tests/classes/inheritance_007).

